+// (`as_flat().ok_or(SegmentedMapUnsupported)?`, `reconstruction.rs:332`/`:583`/`:636`), so ONE
+// segmented object turns repair into an `Err` for EVERY object, and it walks the namespace once per
+// QUEUED OBLIGATION (`:322`/`:620`) — a Q×N loop that stops converging. Eight legs over ONE
+// fixture, each driving `reconcile_step`, the real fenced control point; **none names a symbol this
+// patch introduces** (the red leg reverts production, so one would fail to COMPILE and score no red
+// at all). Legs 1-6 go red on the base; leg 7 passes before and after, and so does leg 8's
+// containment half — only the rule E attribution leg 8 also asserts is new. The one write nothing
+// downstream can take back — `put_fragment`, which OVERWRITES and precedes the CAS — is bound
+// inside legs 1 and 3 rather than by a leg of its own: leg 3 pins that a claimed slot holding bytes
+// this pass never read is withheld **while the reading has a hole in it**, and leg 1 pins that a
+// healthy store's repair still lands over a stray, so the guard can never become a stall with no
+// exit.
